WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.590
I am leaving my
 territory in your care, Brutus.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:07.870
My liege.

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:11.270
Are you certain you do 
not need me by your side?

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:13.950
You are the only one I can trust.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:17.340
We wouldn't want to be plagued 
by worry after I leave, would we?

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:22.590
A report has come in from Admiral Magellan.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:27.290
It seems you intend to 
start a war without me.

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:30.600
Why do you think that?

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.200
How many years have I served you?

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:39.700
My liege would think now is the
 most opportune time to strike the Oda.

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:42.950
I cannot deceive you.

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:45.700
It is just as you said.

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:50.430
Nobunaga's page was the girl
 Sir da Vinci took from Domrémy village.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:51.970
Domrémy?

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:53.730
Then it's that...

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:55.300
That's right.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.950
Jeanne Kaguya d'Arc,
 known for hearing the voice of Heaven.

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:01.830
One wonders what exactly she's heard...

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:05.040
Sir da Vinci planned this from the start.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:10.310
Either way, we cannot let 
the Oda do as they please.

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:13.900
I must teach them what happens to those

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:16.640
who anger me.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:59.760
Even on the Star of the East,
 few nations have so

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.110
many Giant War Armors.

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:05.360
Not to mention, they all bear Regalia.

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:07.850
We could say that they
 are an exceptional war asset.

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:11.990
The surrounding nations will
 tremble just from hearing Oda's name!

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:15.080
Don't get ahead of yourself, Hideyoshi.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:17.240
What? Why not?

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:21.040
Fear also invites caution.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:25.000
Expecting peace is naïve.

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:26.550
But because of these,

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:31.290
nations are seeking to
 become allies with us in droves.

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.010
That's true, but...

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:36.670
<i>As Nobunaga said,</i>

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:40.510
<i>the addition of Goku had 
grown Oda's military might</i>

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:44.030
<i>to rival that of a large nation.</i>

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:49.520
<i>Regalia-enhanced Giant War Armors 
can match a thousand enemies.</i>

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:56.520
<i>Before their might,
 normal Giant War Armors are powerless.</i>

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.030
<i>For that reason,</i>

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.710
<i>Owari's neighboring nations 
were faced with a decision:</i>

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:03.470
<i>enter an alliance with Nobunaga,</i>

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:09.600
<i>or go to war while they still could.</i>

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:12.720
My concern is Caesar.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:16.820
I find it implausible that he 
would step aside for long.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:18.550
He will come soon enough.

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:21.620
If I were him,

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:24.390
I would come to crush us 
before we gain experience

00:04:24.390 --> 00:04:26.450
in using Giant War Armors in battle.

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:28.560
And I would use all my power.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.340
Mitsu, are we making good progress 
on the evacuation of our people?

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.610
Yes, it is nearly complete.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.570
They took a lot of persuading.

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:42.150
But even if the city burns,

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:44.350
if the people are safe,
 the nation will survive.

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:50.350
If it comes to it, I will 
welcome them onto my ship.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:51.930
That would be a great help.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:52.950
I'm counting on you.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.250
Your will is my command!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.860
That will not be necessary.

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:02.220
Orléans' Regalia of protection 
is an impenetrable defense.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.990
I will not let them lay a 
finger on the people.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:05.870
Oh?

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.360
Boldly spoken, Ranmaru.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.100
In any case,

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:15.380
I am not so certain about
 relying on your Orléans alone...

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:16.520
What?!

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:22.120
Then perhaps we can seek 
guidance from the cards?

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:36.210
What an ominous card.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:40.630
All things have a beginning and an end,

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:43.010
a life... and a death.

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:45.180
Death...

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:49.750
There is a time limit to the 
Giant War Armor's operation.

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:54.020
In addition, if you activate the 
Regalia beyond its capacity,

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:56.660
you will cause the Giant 
War Armor to overheat.

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:00.390
That would be like inviting 
Death himself to your doorstep.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.810
Mine didn't show any signs, though.

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:04.490
No...

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:07.730
The longer you are in battle, 
the heavier the controls feel.

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:11.260
Is that what you called 
over... over... over-what?

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.060
Overheating.

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:12.890
Overheating.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:13.500
I see.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:18.250
You cannot protect
 people through rash action.

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:20.950
In the current circumstance,

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:24.010
the failure of one may
 destroy the strategy of all involved.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.280
I will not be defeated by death!

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:30.870
I will protect everyone, 
even if it costs me my life!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.640
Your resolve is commendable.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.420
Alexander, is that you?

00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:59.920
Everything flows without cease,

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:02.770
carried as if by a river's flow.

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:06.690
Soon, there will be unrest 
on the Star of the East.

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:11.480
What manner of man will come sit 
with us at the Round Table?

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:13.760
I can hardly wait.

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:16.500
Indeed, {Your Majesty the }Savior-King.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:22.200
<i>Arthur's words soon came to pass.</i>

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:28.630
<i>Caesar's forces invaded Nobunaga's Owari.</i>

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:35.070
A...

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:36.990
Alas...

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:40.690
Retreat!

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:41.720
Retreat!

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.390
Nobuhide-sama!

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:49.490
Hayashi-dono and Shibata-dono 
have both died in battle.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.630
They died with honor as warriors.

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:58.930
The enemy has currently stationed 
two War Armor battalions

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:00.510
on the mountains to the north,

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:03.620
two War Armor battalions and 
one Giant War Armor unit

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:05.090
in the forests to the west,

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:08.270
and three War Armor battalions
 with three Giant War Armors

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:11.910
on the hills to the east, which we 
believe to be their main encampment.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:16.730
Lastly, they have twelve ships 
along the lakeshore before us.

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:18.890
What say you, Mitsu?

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.800
We are completely surrounded.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:23.100
Caesar must intend to 
exterminate the Oda.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:30.470
I thought that fop was only good at 
cheap tricks and underestimated him,

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:35.620
but this is a pretty grand 
strategy for storming a castle.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:42.150
Caesar-sama, all of your 
men are in position.

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:43.890
All right.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.650
Seek Nobunaga's head!

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.840
All forces, attack!

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:10.760
The die has been cast!

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:18.390
A clash of the titans.

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:27.500
Are our people safe?

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.330
They are fine.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:32.890
Ichihime-sama directed 
the evacuation herself.

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:40.080
Caesar's main force 
have begun their advance!

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:43.250
The enemy has us outnumbered.

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:45.770
We are surrounded on all 
sides, with no exit path.

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:49.540
So, how will we turn the tide, Nobu?

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:52.460
Ranmaru!

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.460
Monkey!

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:55.620
We're going out there 
with our Giant War Armors!

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:11.350
I am Oda Nobunaga, ruler of Owari!

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:14.630
Do not let cannon fire cease!

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:16.410
Engulf the Oda with a sea of fire!

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:26.420
I will protect this nation!

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:35.700
Hey, who gave you permission to disembark?!

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:53.430
I am Goku, Toyotomi Hideyoshi!

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:55.010
Here I come!

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:09.500
Tea's ready!

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:12.550
Would you like some torta 
di cioccolata, as well?

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:25.690
Oda's Giant War Armors may be

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:28.880
blowing steam right about now.

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:44.160
Make sure Orléans cools down!

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:47.410
You! Don't throw water
 on the heat dispersal unit!

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:48.900
You'll get a vapor explosion!

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:50.560
Wow.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.370
It's like a sauna.

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.280
How's maintenance on the Armors going?

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:56.420
Please wait a while.

00:11:56.880 --> 00:12:01.650
We are having some difficulty 
dispersing the internal heat buildup.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.560
Please eat your fill.

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:16.730
Don't rush. Line up.

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.710
There's still a lot left!

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:21.730
Here.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.310
Thank you.

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:31.290
What's this?

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:35.550
<i>A great view, wouldn't you say?</i>

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:39.090
<i>We're broadcasting live 
from the Amenotorifune.</i>

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:41.580
<i>It was Mitsuhide-dono's idea.</i>

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:45.330
<i>This allows us to accurately track 
what's happening on the battlefield.</i>

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:49.100
Wow, you could charge people for this view!

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:53.750
Caesar might make his move soon.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:54.730
Yeah.

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:56.920
He'd wait until our units overheated,

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.110
then deploy his Quo Vadis.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.880
After the afternoon battle,

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:05.850
our Giant War Armors' 
operational time limit

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:07.870
has decreased considerably.

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:10.380
We'll have to end it quickly.

00:13:11.610 --> 00:13:14.860
His spear of light's a problem.

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:20.000
Da Vinci-dono and I made a discovery 
about it during our analysis.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:23.160
His spear of light is indeed powerful.

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:26.940
But for that reason, he cannot fire 
it in succession at full strength.

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:29.040
Once he uses the weapon,

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:32.310
he'll need time to recharge it.

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:34.430
So he's vulnerable then.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:36.060
Right.

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:39.650
So we'll first lure Caesar in and 
have him fire his spear of light.

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:43.000
Ranmaru's Orléans will deflect it.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:46.220
Before Caesar can fire a second time,

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:48.720
Nobu and Hideyoshi will attack.

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:52.930
But will it go as we've planned?

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:55.900
That is why we'll have
 Himiko-sama play a role, as well.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:58.570
<i>Me?</i>

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:10.610
Nobunaga...

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:12.980
it is time to end this.

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:23.490
Dragons, let us begin 
this delightful banquet.

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:32.870
Here he comes.

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:34.100
Nobu!

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.420
Caesar's on the move!

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:38.740
Ranmaru! Monkey! Let's go!

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:39.410
Understood!

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:40.240
Okay!

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:12.710
The general himself has finally come.

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:14.880
Nobunaga!

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:19.310
Caesar!

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:26.790
It's time to pay you back for my 
humiliation at Takamagahara!

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:34.900
He took the bait!

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:37.130
I will be victorious!

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:46.980
Now, Nobu, Hideyoshi!

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.500
All right!

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:53.320
We were waiting for this!

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:02.890
Not yet.

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:07.530
Rampage further, dragons.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:14.300
What?!

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:16.020
It's recharging so slowly...

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:20.940
Maintain altitude while staying 
out of enemy fire range.

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:21.810
Understood.

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:27.380
Draw as much ley line 
energy into the condenser

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:28.630
as it can handle!

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:31.350
Don't let it flow to 
Caesar's Giant War Armor!

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:32.550
Yes, Your Highness.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.060
It worked.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.960
You interfered with the ley lines?!

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:39.960
Caesar!

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:42.460
What?

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:44.300
Monkey!

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:45.810
Got it!

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:57.550
Apologize to Dad and 
Lord Shingen in the afterlife!

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:00.450
Defeated?

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:04.590
Me? Here?

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:06.320
Nay!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:08.260
This cannot be!

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:11.530
What's this?

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:17.500
This is the end!

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:19.330
Power!

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:23.510
More power to me, Gaius Julius Caesar!

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:25.270
What?!

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:30.450
Goddess!

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:32.140
Quo Vadis!

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:38.850
The dragon responded to Caesar's wish!

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:43.080
Your Highness,
 the quantum condenser's readings

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:44.460
are at abnormally high levels!

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:49.460
What is about to happen?!

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:51.860
My betrothed...

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:55.200
My thanks, Star of the East!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:57.870
I see you will lend me your power!

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:01.780
My power...?!

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:08.580
Damn!

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:11.820
Veni,

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:14.320
vidi,

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:16.730
vici!

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:19.730
Condemnation!

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:22.960
Nobu?!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:23.970
What is this?!

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:25.070
My betrothed?!

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:30.310
Don't!

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:48.390
No!

00:18:48.590 --> 00:18:49.860
Ranmaru!

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:56.530
Nobu-sama!

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:13.520
No!

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:24.330
Die! Die!

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:26.140
Die lots!

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:27.460
Die even more!

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:29.590
Die and die again!

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:40.990
Ichihime-sama, are you hurt?

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:42.560
No...

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:44.730
What about you all?

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:47.510
We are fine.

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:49.590
This way, please.

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:36.330
But I tried to protect them!

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:44.340
It's...

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:46.790
just like that card...

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:51.890
I am Death!

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:56.870
I was supposed to be the 
one to draw the card.

00:20:57.530 --> 00:20:59.340
You are not Death.

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:00.980
I am.

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:04.210
Nobunaga!

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:26.040
You were already skilled
 at stabbing others in the back.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:29.150
You could kill two with one blow right now.

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:33.580
I do not find it shameful 
to attack from behind.

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:35.360
But,

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:38.490
I dislike killing women.

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:44.450
Mademoiselle Jeanne Kaguya 
d'Arc of Domrémy.

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:49.820
I have won this war, Oda Nobunaga.

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:52.730
Further strife would be meaningless.

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:55.150
Submit to me.

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:11.400
What is your response?

00:22:15.840 --> 00:22:19.030
Do Western warlords drink tea?

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:20.230
What?

00:22:20.710 --> 00:22:22.640
Tea... you say?

00:22:23.580 --> 00:22:25.940
If you do, come along.

00:22:25.940 --> 00:22:27.890
I'll invite you to a tea party.

00:22:28.350 --> 00:22:29.360
What?!

00:22:30.670 --> 00:22:33.340
And I'll settle the score with you,

00:22:34.280 --> 00:22:35.470
Caesar!

00:24:12.200 --> 00:24:14.880
Yet another flower has fallen.

00:24:15.740 --> 00:24:17.090
Time continues on,

00:24:17.090 --> 00:24:19.180
and the flower remains adrift in the flow.

00:24:19.840 --> 00:24:21.850
Next time: The Fool.

00:24:22.430 --> 00:24:25.260
May this song reach him.
